@startuml
title VibeGraph Recommendation Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User
participant "React View" as FE
participant "Recommendation API" as RecAPI
participant "Recommendation Logic" as RecLogic
database "Neo4j Graph DB" as Neo4j
participant "AI Explanation API" as ExplainAPI
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

User -> FE : Click the Generate Recommendation button
FE -> RecAPI : GET /recommendations/{userId}

RecAPI -> RecLogic : Request recommendations based on user taste
RecLogic -> Neo4j : Find candidate tracks connected to frequently played genres

alt Recommendation candidates exist
Neo4j --> RecLogic : Return candidate tracks, scores, and recommendation paths
RecLogic --> RecAPI : Organize recommendation results
RecAPI --> FE : Return recommendation candidate list
FE -> User : Display recommended tracks and graph paths
else No recommendation candidates
Neo4j --> RecLogic : Return empty result
RecLogic --> RecAPI : No recommendation candidates
RecAPI --> FE : Return insufficient data message
FE -> User : Suggest syncing more playlists
end

User -> FE : Click the Generate Explanation button
FE -> ExplainAPI : POST /agent/explain\nSend candidates and taste profile

ExplainAPI -> OpenAI : Request recommendation explanation using a prompt

alt Explanation generated successfully
OpenAI --> ExplainAPI : Return playlist name, overall explanation, and track-level reasons
ExplainAPI --> FE : Return AI explanation result
FE -> User : Display playlist name and reasons for each track
else Explanation generation failed
OpenAI --> ExplainAPI : Return an error or invalid response
ExplainAPI --> FE : Return explanation failure message
FE -> User : Display AI explanation error
end

@enduml
